// `std.net`: the home of the network's host interface, `std.net.Eff`, whose
// operations open, accept, write, read and close a stream to a peer. A source
// names the interface where it imports this module, `import std.net;`, and
// nowhere else. The interface is native, so no declaration here
// states it. The pool capability and its streams wait for demand.
//
// - see: #4523
